---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Us - Aura & Scape"
  description="Meet Antima & Shilpa, the creative duo behind Aura & Scape. Luxury event planning and decoration in Edinburgh, Scotland."
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1>About Aura & Scape</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 16px auto 0;">Two friends, one dream — making every celebration feel like a story worth remembering.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founders -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid reveal">
        <div class="about-photos">
          <div class="founder">
            <img src="/assets/hero/antima.jpg" alt="Antima, co-founder of Aura and Scape" class="founder-photo" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
            <h3>Antima</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">Co-Founder</p>
          </div>
          <div class="founder">
            <img src="/assets/hero/shilpa.jpg" alt="Shilpa, co-founder of Aura and Scape" class="founder-photo" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
            <h3>Shilpa</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">Co-Founder</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2>Two Friends, One Dream</h2>
          <p>Aura & Scape was born from a simple belief: every celebration should feel like a story worth remembering. We're Antima and Shilpa — two friends who found their calling in the art of transformation.</p>
          <p>What started as decorating a friend's intimate gathering grew into a shared passion for crafting spaces that don't just look beautiful — they make you <em>feel</em> something.</p>
          <p>Today, we pour that same care into every event we touch. Whether it's a grand wedding or a quiet anniversary, we bring the same energy: attention to detail, a love of colour, and a genuine desire to see your face when you walk into the space we've created.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quote -->
  <section class="section section--rose">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <blockquote class="founder-quote">
        "Where creativity meets elegance, and every celebration becomes an unforgettable experience."
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-line"></span>
        <h2>What Guides Us</h2>
        <span class="section-line"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid reveal-stagger">
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3>Dream First</h3>
          <p>We start with your vision, not our templates. Your event should feel unmistakably yours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3>Decorate with Heart</h3>
          <p>Every petal, every light, every drape is placed with intention. Nothing is arbitrary. Everything is felt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3>Celebrate Fully</h3>
          <p>We handle the logistics so you can be fully present in your celebration. You live the moment. We guard the details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Journey -->
  <section class="section section--rose">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-line"></span>
        <h2>How We Got Here</h2>
        <span class="section-line"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline reveal-stagger">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>The Spark</h3>
          <p>Antima decorated Shilpa's sister's engagement on a tight budget. The photos went viral in their friend group. The next request came that weekend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>Finding Our Voice</h3>
          <p>Three wedding seasons in, we realised our style: soft pastels, meaningful touches, and a refusal to copy the "standard" look. Clients started asking for us by name.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>Aura & Scape is Born</h3>
          <p>We stopped doing favours and started doing this full-time. A name that captures what we do: the <em>aura</em> we create, the <em>scape</em> we build around it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>Now</h3>
          <p>A small team with big ambitions. Every event still gets our full attention. We'd rather do 20 events beautifully than 100 events well-enough.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2>Let's Create Together</h2>
      <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 480px; margin: 16px auto 32px;">Every great event starts with a conversation. Tell us what you're dreaming of.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 120px 48px 60px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 100px 20px 40px; }
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  }

  .about-photos {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-photos { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
  }

  .founder {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .founder-photo {
    width: 240px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 120px 120px 0 0;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founder-photo { width: 180px; height: 220px; border-radius: 90px 90px 0 0; }
  }

  .founder h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .about-text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .founder-quote {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 32px 48px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founder-quote { padding: 24px 24px; font-size: 17px; }
  }

  /* Values */
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .value-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-rose);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 40px 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Timeline */
  .timeline {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .timeline-item h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .timeline-item p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
